Title
Library Borrowing Record Management using Python
Aim
To develop a Python program for managing library borrowing records and perform statistical 
operations such as average, maximum, minimum, zero borrow count, and mode using Hungarian 
notation.

Problem Statement
Write a Python program to manage the borrowing records of books in a library. Implement the 
following functionalities:
• Compute the average number of books borrowed by all library members. 
• Find the highest and lowest number of borrowings. 
• Count the number of members who have not borrowed any books (borrow count = 0). 
• Display the most frequently borrowed count (Mode). 
• Determine the Time and Space Complexity of each operation.
